return ['domain'=>'zinn-connector','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'so_SO','project-id-version'=>'zinn-connector','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:54+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-06T10:05:54+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Connector'=>'Zinn® Connector','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-connector','Connects this WordPress site to Zinn Digital® so scheduled articles can be published to it. Paste a pairing code from your Zinn® dashboard and the plugin sets up its own credential — nothing is copied by hand.'=>'Wuxuu ku xidhayaa boggatan WordPress adeegga Zinn Digital® si qoraallada loo qorsheeyay loogu daabaco. Ku dheji koodhka lammaanaynta ee laga keenay guddigaaga Zinn® waana in plugin-ku uu dejiyo aqoonsigiisa — waxna gacanta looma guuriyo.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','This site\'s PHP cannot create archives, so a backup could not be made.'=>'PHP-ga goobtan ma abuuri karo kaydad (archives), sidaa darteed lama samayn karo keyd-celis (backup).','Could not create a temporary file.'=>'Lama abuuro fayl ku-meel-gaar ah.','This site\'s files could not be archived.'=>'Waqtigaan faylasha boggan lama keydin karo.','The archive could not be read back.'=>'Kaydka lama akhrin karin.','The backup could not be uploaded.'=>'Gurmadka lama soo gelin karo.','The backup upload was rejected.'=>'Soodhicista kaydka waa la diiday.','This WordPress user cannot publish posts, so a connection made now could not publish either. Sign in as a user who can, and try again.'=>'Isticmaalahan WordPress wuxuu daabici karin qoraallo, markaa xiriir hadda la sameeyay ma daabici karo midkoodna. Sida isticmaale awood u leh u gal, oo mar kale isku day.','Application passwords are turned off on this site, so we cannot create a credential. Ask your host to enable them, or connect the site with a password you create yourself in your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Erayada sirta ee codsiga waa la damiyay boggan, markaas ma abuuri karno aqoonsi. Weydii martigeliyahaaga inuu shido, ama ku xidh bogga eray sir ah oo aad adigu ka samaysatay sabuuraddaada Zinn Digital®.','WordPress would not create a credential for this site. Nothing has been sent anywhere.'=>'WordPress ma abuuri karto aqoonsi goobtan. Waxba meelna looma dirin.','We could not reach Zinn Digital® from this site. Nothing was connected, and the credential we made has been removed. Check the site can make outgoing requests, and try again.'=>'Ma aannaan gaarin Zinn Digital® goobtan laga bilaabo. Waxba kuma xirnayn, xogta aqoonsiga ee aan samaynayna waa la saaray. Hubi in goobtu samayn karto codsiyo dibadda u baxaya, oo dib u day.','Zinn Digital® did not accept that pairing code. Nothing was connected. Generate a fresh code in your dashboard and try again.'=>'Zinn Digital® ma aysan aqbalin lambarkaas lammaanaynta ah. Waxba lama xiriirin. Ka soo abuur lambar cusub dashboard-kaaga oo dib u day.','Connected. Zinn Digital® can now publish to this site.'=>'Waa la xiriiriyay. Zinn Digital® hadda waxay daabici kartaa boggan.','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — hageyaasha iyo adeegyada','User guides'=>'Hagaha isticmaalaha','Read the %s user guide'=>'Akhri buug-gacmeedka isticmaalaha ee %s','Hide this'=>'Qari tan','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'Hsingka Zinn® ee WordPress','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kaydinta maalinlaha ah, haajiradda bilaashka ah iyo guddiga maamulka ee loogu talagalay dadka wada in ka badan hal mareeg.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Suuqa Zinn®','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Iibso oo iibi mareegaha, domain-yada iyo meelaha isku xirka ee la dhisay, iyadoo lacagta si ammaan ah loo hayo illaa labada dhinac ay ka qanacayaan.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — kireyso dadkan shaqadan u leh nolosha','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Suuqayada xorta ah ee caalamiga ah: ka baadh in ka badan 10,000 adeeg oo diyaar u ah qorayaasha, naqshadeeyayaasha, horumariyayaasha iyo khubarada SEO, ama soo dhig mashruuc oo u oggolow inay dalbadaan.','This site is connected to Zinn Digital®, publishing as %s.'=>'Webkaan wuxuu ku xiran yahay Zinn Digital®, oo daabacaya sida %s.','To disconnect, revoke the “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” application password on %s.'=>'Si aad u gooyso xiriirka, kala noqo erayga sirta ah ee barnaamijka “Zinn Digital® (publishing)” ee ku yaal %s.','your profile'=>'agaarkaaga','Connect this site'=>'Ku xidh boggan','Open your Zinn Digital® dashboard, go to Content → Other sites, and press “Get a pairing code”. Paste it below.'=>'Fur गर्नुहोस् dashboard-kaaga Zinn Digital®, tag Content → Other sites, oo riix “Get a pairing code”. Ku dheji hoos.','Pairing code'=>'Sumeynta lambarka sirta ah','It expires thirty minutes after you generate it, and can only be used once.'=>'Waxay dhacaysaa soddon daqiiqo ka dib marka aad soo saarto, waxaana la isticmaali karaa hal mar oo keliya.','You are not allowed to connect this site.'=>'Laguma oggola inaad ku xirto bishan.','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Fiiri qoraallada sii-daynta ee Zinn Digital®.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Cusboonaysiintii la soo dejiyey ayaa ku guuldareysatay baaritaanka hufnaanta waxaana la rakibay.']];